  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.08 File electronically",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.08 “File electronically” means to file a document, using the online commission portals, by:\n\n(a) Using the electronic filing system, if available, at https://www.puc.nh.gov; or\n\n(b) Sending an email to the commissions clerk’s office at ClerksOffice@puc.nh.gov with documents attached in a file format accepted by the commission in accordance with Puc 203.03.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
